                <pb facs="0508" n="428" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg428"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-30"><hi rendition="#italic">May 30,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>German Government has not the slightest objection to having Cuban interests
                    represented for the present as heretofore.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
